majoris-browser (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Correct cancelled clear-on-exit and durable web-app uninstall recovery.
  * Qualify partition-aware cookie and engine storage-key clearing.
  * Complete modern credentials, contextual address filling and GTK page actions.
  * Bridge Chromium accessibility to GTK/AT-SPI and real OSR drag/input.
  * Require GTK 4.18, libpsl and expanded integration-test dependencies.
  * Keep unavailable OSR PiP and unverified target-desktop gates explicit.

